\fs28\b Lab 11.5 Test Suite Summary\b0\par
\par
\fs24\b Number of tests\b0\par
11 automated tests.\par
\par
\b Types of tests\b0\par
- Unit tests for Task and TaskRepository.\par
- Widget tests for empty state and task creation.\par
- Navigation test for opening TaskDetailScreen.\par
- Integration-style widget test for add, edit, save, and return-to-list flow.\par
\par
\b Behaviors validated\b0\par
- New tasks default to incomplete.\par
- toggle() switches completion state both directions.\par
- Repository add, delete, and update operations work.\par
- Task list renders the empty state.\par
- Users can add one or multiple tasks.\par
- Tapping a task opens the detail screen.\par
- Saving an edited title updates the task list.\par
\par
\b Known limitations\b0\par
- The integration test runs with Flutter's widget test framework, not on a real device through the integration_test package.\par
- DevTools screenshots must be captured manually from a debug session before final submission.\par
}
